What's so strange about that to you?  The presence of a vault on DL1
or what happened when the guard showed up?  Vaults may be generated on
any level of the main dungeon branch except the rogue level, Medusa's
lair, and the castle (and the bigroom if you happen to get one).

There is a correct reply to the guard's question to make him leave you
alone, but the vault magically closes itself up on you again.  The
guard has no idea how much money started off in the vault, so he
suspects that you've stolen everything in your possession.  You can
either follow him out and figure out a way to get back and recover all
the gold, or you can give him the correct answer and figure your own
way out of the vault.

